{
 "id": "seg2",
 "title": "事故档案馆",
 "pill": 2,
 "total": 90.52,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先给一句准确的说法。",
   "spoken": "先给一句准确的说法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg2-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 1.76,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 3.148
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "大多数事故不是新漏洞，而是旧漏洞在新环境里复发。",
   "spoken": "大多数事故不是新漏洞，而是旧漏洞在新环境里复发。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg2-01.wav",
   "start": 3.58,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 3.673,
   "speechEnd": 8.057
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "新环境可以是一条新链，一个分叉，一个新版本，或者一种新的组合方式。",
   "spoken": "新环境可以是一条新链，一个分叉，一个新版本，或者一种新的组合方式。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg2-02.wav",
   "start": 8.44,
   "dur": 6.56,
   "speechStart": 8.534,
   "speechEnd": 14.768
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "打个比方，航空业把每一起事故，都写成公开报告。",
   "spoken": "打个比方，航空业把每一起事故，都写成公开报告。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg2-03.wav",
   "start": 15.22,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speechStart": 15.318,
   "speechEnd": 19.496
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "所以今天的飞行员，不会再犯 1970 年代的错误。",
   "spoken": "所以今天的飞行员，不会再犯 1970 年代的错误。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg2-04.wav",
   "start": 19.92,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "speechStart": 19.92,
   "speechEnd": 23.724
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "链上安全也有自己的事故报告，项目复盘，安全公司分析，还有链上数据。",
   "spoken": "链上安全也有自己的事故报告，项目复盘，安全公司分析，还有链上数据。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg2-05.wav",
   "start": 24.14,
   "dur": 6.24,
   "speechStart": 24.232,
   "speechEnd": 30.183
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "读事故报告，是成本最低的安全训练。",
   "spoken": "读事故报告，是成本最低的安全训练。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg2-06.wav",
   "start": 30.6,
   "dur": 3.04,
   "speechStart": 30.697,
   "speechEnd": 33.466
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "这个比方有一处不成立。",
   "spoken": "这个比方有一处不成立。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg2-07.wav",
   "start": 33.86,
   "dur": 1.84,
   "speechStart": 33.953,
   "speechEnd": 35.454
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "航空事故由独立机构调查，结论有权威性。",
   "spoken": "航空事故由独立机构掉查，结论有权威性。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg2-08.wav",
   "start": 35.92,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 35.92,
   "speechEnd": 39.544
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "链上事故的复盘，多数由项目方或安全公司发布。",
   "spoken": "链上事故的复盘，多数由项目方或安全公司发布。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg2-09.wav",
   "start": 39.98,
   "dur": 4.16,
   "speechStart": 40.076,
   "speechEnd": 43.967
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "细节可能不完整，归因也可能有争议。",
   "spoken": "细节可能不完整，归因也可能有争议。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg2-10.wav",
   "start": 44.36,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speechStart": 44.36,
   "speechEnd": 47.46
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "所以读复盘时，只采信多方公开资料一致的事实。",
   "spoken": "所以读复盘时，只采信多方公开资料一致的事实。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg2-11.wav",
   "start": 47.86,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 47.955,
   "speechEnd": 52.232
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "在这座档案馆里，每一起事故按两个标签归档，根因类别和链。",
   "spoken": "在这座档案馆里，每一起事故按两个标签归档，根因类别和链。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg2-12.wav",
   "start": 52.64,
   "dur": 6.24,
   "speechStart": 52.64,
   "speechEnd": 58.678
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "以太坊和多链，BNB Chain，TRON，Mantle，各有一面展墙。",
   "spoken": "以太坊和多链，BNB Chain，TRON，Mantle，各有一面展墙。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg2-13.wav",
   "start": 59.1,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 59.198,
   "speechEnd": 64.178
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "还有两面，一面放代码之外的事故，一面放 NFT 与 GameFi。",
   "spoken": "还有两面，一面放代码之外的事故，一面放 NFT 与 GameFi。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg2-14.wav",
   "start": 64.6,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 64.6,
   "speechEnd": 69.812
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "金额都是事发时的美元估值，只能看作约数。",
   "spoken": "金额都是事发时的美元估值，只能看作约数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg2-15.wav",
   "start": 70.26,
   "dur": 4.4,
   "speechStart": 70.26,
   "speechEnd": 74.428
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "没有摆上展墙的，不代表没有发生。",
   "spoken": "没有摆上展墙的，不代表没有发生。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg2-16.wav",
   "start": 74.88,
   "dur": 2.72,
   "speechStart": 74.983,
   "speechEnd": 77.411
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "六十多起事故摆在一起，反复出现的，其实只有八种模式。",
   "spoken": "六十多起事故摆在一起，反复出现的，其实只有八种模式。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg2-17.wav",
   "start": 77.82,
   "dur": 4.96,
   "speechStart": 77.913,
   "speechEnd": 82.611
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-18",
   "text": "前五种藏在代码和版本里，后三种，出在签名、密钥和人身上。",
   "spoken": "前五种藏在代码和版本里，后三种，出在签名、密钥和人身上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg2-18.wav",
   "start": 83.0,
   "dur": 6.32,
   "speechStart": 83.0,
   "speechEnd": 89.086
  }
